{"4113580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "D.U.M.B", "steam_appid": 4113580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113580/extras/d7f1f9a81084077a6636d8fa8f0f486f.avif?t=1773934945\" width=930 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been recruited by the <strong>D.U.M.B.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission?</strong> Prevent the Intruders from stealing your resources and escaping the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113580/extras/9ae8f10b9fbc035dfe861af348ad9900.avif?t=1773934945\" width=1122 height=742 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Intruder’s gameplay <strong>leans toward</strong> an extraction-style game: complete your missions, infiltrate areas, and escape without being detected. Use your special abilities to deceive your opponents and achieve your objective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113580/extras/e6c733ebe1e6e175be4e591ba48a1aca.avif?t=1773934945\" width=1088 height=751 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Agents experience <strong>blends</strong> a game of cat and mouse with objective defense. Use a wide selection of items and gadgets to protect your area, trap your opponents, and lead your team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113580/